<title>USA: Citizens Telecom, U S West in resale pact.</title>
<headline>Citizens Telecom, U S West in resale pact.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Telecom and U S West Communications Group signed an agreement last week allowing Citizens to resell U S West's switched telecommunications services to customers in seven western U.S. states, the companies said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Citizens Telecom, part of Citizens Utilities Co, will add U S West's local dial tone, private line and other services to its offerings in Oregon, Washington, Arizona, New Mexico, Montana, Idaho and Utah.</p>
<p>The agreement lasts for one year, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
